  "description": "Bambieta, the chancellor who was stabbed and murdered by the sword of Lusley—the very monarch she raised to the throne. At the threshold of death, she enters into a contract with mysterious monsters and regresses 10 years into the past.\n\nThe contract has only one condition: place Nenya, an ordinary girl, upon the throne of the Karia Empire.\nHowever, if Nenya dies, Bambieta is forced to regress to the past once again.\n\nHer once-confident ambition is…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856368), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14816007)",
